# Final Academic Project Deliverables & Submission Checklist

## 1. Project Implementation Milestones
- [x] Milestone 1: Level 0 Foundation Prototype (WASM on-device MiniLM embedding worker, Manifest V3).
- [x] Milestone 2: Capture & Tiered Storage (Readability DOM extractor, Markdown parser, IndexedDB `meridian-db`, SQ8 Quantization >74%, OPFS snapshots).
- [x] Milestone 3: Intent Vector Search (In-memory cosine similarity search ranking, sub-20ms SRL latency).
- [x] Milestone 4: Deep Research Chunking & Multi-Source Ingestion (PDF byte parser with 1-based page numbers, 256w/50o sliding chunker, slide-over Passage Inspector).
- [x] Milestone 5: 2D Spatial Knowledge Canvas (HTML5 Canvas 60 FPS viewport with culling, non-blocking UMAP layout worker, spring-force collision physics, pin locks).
- [x] Milestone 6: Product Completion & Portability (Versioned JSON workspace export/import, standalone offline single-file HTML archive export, 7-day LRU snapshot cache purge).
- [x] Milestone 7: Performance Verification & Academic Report (Automated Playwright test harness, 33 verified test cases in Test_Case.xlsx, complete final academic report in main.tex).

